  "prefLabel": "Puc 508.05 Reports Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 508.05 Reports Required.\n\n(a) Each utility shall file an annual report with the commission and the department regarding the advertising or activities described in Puc 508.02.\n\n(b) This report shall itemize the expenses incurred by type of advertising and activity and shall specifically delineate those expenditures for which cost recovery is sought.\n\n(c) The report shall be included with the utility's annual report to the department filed in accordance with En 509.02.\n\n(d) Each utility shall keep copies of all its advertising on file for inspection by the commission or the department.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 500) #13794, eff 10-25-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc500.html"
